  "type": "songs",
  "content": "<div class=\"page-links\">Pages: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/strawberry-fields-forever/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">1</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/strawberry-fields-forever/2/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">2</span></a> <span class=\"post-page-numbers current\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"page-link\">3</span></span></div><div id=\"ez-toc-container\" class=\"ez-toc-v2_0_89 ez-toc-wrap-right counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-grey ez-toc-container-direction\"><div class=\"ez-toc-title-container\"><p class=\"ez-toc-title\" style=\"cursor:inherit\">Contents</p>\n<span class=\"ez-toc-title-toggle\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"ez-toc-pull-right ez-toc-btn ez-toc-btn-xs ez-toc-btn-default ez-toc-toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle Table of Content\"><span class=\"ez-toc-js-icon-con\"><span class=\"\"><span class=\"eztoc-hide\" style=\"display:none;\">Toggle</span><span class=\"ez-toc-icon-toggle-span\"><svg style=\"fill: #999;color:#999\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"list-377408\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M6 6H4v2h2V6zm14 0H8v2h12V6zM4 11h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2zM4 16h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg><svg style=\"fill: #999;color:#999\" class=\"arrow-unsorted-368013\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10px\" height=\"10px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.2\" baseProfile=\"tiny\"><path d=\"M18.2 9.3l-6.2-6.3-6.2 6.3c-.2.2-.3.4-.3.7s.1.5.3.7c.2.2.4.3.7.3h11c.3 0 .5-.1.7-.3.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7zM5.8 14.7l6.2 6.3 6.2-6.3c.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7c-.2-.2-.4-.3-.7-.3h-11c-.3 0-.5.1-.7.3-.2.2-.3.5-.3.7s.1.5.3.7z\"/></svg></span></span></span></a></span></div><nav><ul class='ez-toc-list ez-toc-list-level-1 eztoc-toggle-hide-by-default' ><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-1\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/strawberry-fields-forever/#Personnel\" >Personnel</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-2\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/strawberry-fields-forever/#The_music\" >The music</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-3\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/strawberry-fields-forever/2/#In_the_studio\" >In the studio</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4\" href=\"#The_promo_film\" >The promo film</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5\" href=\"#The_release\" >The release</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"The_promo_film\"></span>The promo film<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2><p>Having decided that their next single would be the double a-side &#8216;Strawberry Fields Forever&#8217; and <a href=\"/songs/penny-lane/\">&#8216;Penny Lane&#8217;</a>, The Beatles appeared in promotional films for both songs.</p><p>Work began on <a href=\"/1967/01/30/filming-strawberry-fields-forever/\">30 January 1967</a> in Knole Park in Sevenoaks, Kent. The films were both produced by Tony Bramwell for Subafilms, and were shot on colour 35mm film by a crew from London-based Don Long Productions.</p><p>The Swedish director was Peter Goldmann, who had been recommended by <a href=\"/people/klaus-voormann/\">Klaus Voormann</a>. Goldmann had arrived in England in early January and looked for suitable locations in London and elsewhere. The first location he decided upon was Knole Park in Sevenoaks, Kent, which was owned by the National Trust. Coincidentally, there is a Knolle Park in Liverpool, just a short distance from Strawberry Field.</p><p>The film for &#8216;Strawberry Fields Forever&#8217; was the first to be shot. A number of sequences were shot around a dead oak tree near the park&#8217;s birdhouse. The tree is no longer there.</p><div class=\"epyt-video-wrapper\"><iframe  id=\"_ytid_80590\"  width=\"580\" height=\"326\"  data-origwidth=\"580\" data-origheight=\"326\"  data-relstop=\"1\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HtUH9z_Oey8?enablejsapi=1&#038;autoplay=0&#038;cc_load_policy=0&#038;cc_lang_pref=&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;loop=0&#038;rel=0&#038;fs=1&#038;playsinline=0&#038;autohide=2&#038;theme=dark&#038;color=red&#038;controls=1&#038;disablekb=0&#038;\" class=\"__youtube_prefs__  epyt-is-override  no-lazyload\" title=\"YouTube player\"  allow=\"fullscreen; accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen data-no-lazy=\"1\" data-skipgform_ajax_framebjll=\"\"></iframe></div><p>The Beatles had intended to film a sequence in which <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a> dropped down from a dead oak tree, but poor light meant it was not possible on the first day. That sequence, and several others, was filmed on <a href=\"/1967/01/31/filming-strawberry-fields-forever-2/\">31 January</a>, which saw the completion of of the shoot.</p><p>In the final edit, the sequence was reversed so it looked as though McCartney leaped into the tree. The planned sequence involved him jumping from the tree and running backwards towards a piano.</p><div data-carousel-extra='{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/strawberry-fields-forever/&quot;}' id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-261 gallery-columns-2 gallery-size-thumbnail'><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTMyIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzMiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"132\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01-200x132.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles filming the Strawberry Fields Forever promo film, January 1967\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01-200x132.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01-580x384.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01-960x636.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01-768x508.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"27123\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,662\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles filming the Strawberry Fields Forever promo film, January 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_01-960x636.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_02/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTM0IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzNCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"134\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_02-200x134.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Paul McCartney filming the Strawberry Fields Forever promo film, January 1967\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_02-200x134.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_02-580x389.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_02-960x643.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_02-768x515.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_02.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"27124\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_02/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_02.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,670\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul McCartney filming the Strawberry Fields Forever promo film, January 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_02-960x643.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_03/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTMzIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzMyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"133\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_03-200x133.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Ringo Starr, Paul McCartney and John Lennon filming the Strawberry Fields Forever promo film, January 1967\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_03-200x133.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_03-580x385.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_03-960x636.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_03-768x509.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_03.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"27125\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_03/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_03.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,663\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Ringo Starr, Paul McCartney and John Lennon filming the Strawberry Fields Forever promo film, January 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_03-960x636.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_04/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxMzMiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTMzIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"133\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_04-133x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"George Harrison filming the Strawberry Fields Forever promo film, January 1967\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_04-133x200.jpg 133w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_04-386x580.jpg 386w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_04-638x960.jpg 638w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_04-768x1155.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_04.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 133px) 100vw, 133px\" data-attachment-id=\"27126\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_04/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_04.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,1504\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"George Harrison filming the Strawberry Fields Forever promo film, January 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/6701-strawberry-fields-forever-promo_04-638x960.jpg\" /></a></div></figure></div><p>During a break in the filming <a href=\"/people/john-lennon/\">John Lennon</a> bought a circus poster dating from 1843 in an antique shop. The poster, which advertised a circus in Rochdale, subsequently provided the inspiration for <a href=\"/songs/being-for-the-benefit-of-mr-kite/\">&#8216;Being For The Benefit Of Mr Kite!&#8217;</a> on the <a href=\"/albums/sgt-peppers-lonely-hearts-club-band/\"><em>Sgt Pepper&#8217;s Lonely Hearts Club Band</em></a> album.</p><p><a href=\"/gallery/1967-photos/john-lennon-mr-kite-poster_01/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-27130\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI1ODAiIGhlaWdodD0iNDcxIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgNTgwIDQ3MSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"27130\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/john-lennon-mr-kite-poster_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-mr-kite-poster_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"886,720\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"John Lennon with the Mr Kite poster, 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-mr-kite-poster_01.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/john-lennon-mr-kite-poster_01-580x471.jpg\" alt=\"John Lennon with the Mr Kite poster, 1967\" width=\"580\" height=\"471\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-27130\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-mr-kite-poster_01-580x471.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-mr-kite-poster_01-200x163.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-mr-kite-poster_01-768x624.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-mr-kite-poster_01.jpg 886w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 580px) 100vw, 580px\" /></a></p><p>The promo film for <a href=\"/songs/penny-lane/\">&#8216;Penny Lane&#8217;</a> was shot from <a href=\"/1967/02/05/filming-penny-lane/\">5 February 1967</a>.</p><h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"The_release\"></span>The release<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2><p>The single <a href=\"/songs/penny-lane/\">&#8216;Penny Lane&#8217;</a>/\u2018Strawberry Fields Forever&#8217; was released in the USA by Capitol Records on <a href=\"/1967/02/13/us-single-penny-lane-strawberry-fields-forever/\">13 February 1967</a>, and by EMI in the UK on <a href=\"/1967/02/17/uk-single-penny-lane-strawberry-fields-forever/\">17 February 1967</a>.</p><p>It was The Beatles&#8217; first single release since <a href=\"/songs/yellow-submarine/\">&#8216;Yellow Submarine&#8217;</a>/<a href=\"/songs/eleanor-rigby/\">&#8216;Eleanor Rigby&#8217;</a> the previous August, and the first UK single to be issued in a picture sleeve.</p><p>The front of the sleeve showed The Beatles&#8217; new hirsute image, while the back cover showed photographs of all four band members as children.</p><div data-carousel-extra='{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/strawberry-fields-forever/&quot;}' id='gallery-2' class='gallery galleryid-261 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail'><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/uk_penny-lane-strawberry-fields-forever_01/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_penny-lane-strawberry-fields-forever_01-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Penny Lane/Strawberry Fields Forever single artwork - United Kingdom\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_penny-lane-strawberry-fields-forever_01-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_penny-lane-strawberry-fields-forever_01-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_penny-lane-strawberry-fields-forever_01-958x960.jpg 958w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_penny-lane-strawberry-fields-forever_01-768x770.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_penny-lane-strawberry-fields-forever_01-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_penny-lane-strawberry-fields-forever_01.jpg 1500w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"10202\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/uk_penny-lane-strawberry-fields-forever_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_penny-lane-strawberry-fields-forever_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1500,1503\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Penny Lane/Strawberry Fields Forever single artwork \u2013 United Kingdom\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-f